OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy, cold and mostly wet
OL,6,Fday with persistent, occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy rain and some strong winds. Any
OL,8,Fsleet or snow across the High Peaks
OL,9,Feasing through the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain and gusty winds will
OL,12,Fgradually ease except in the north of
OL,13,Fthe region. Winds will become light in
OL,14,Fthe south though remaining blustery
OL,15,Falong the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FChangeable, with periods of
OL,18,Frain and sunny intervals during the
OL,19,Fmorning ahead of another band of rain
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon. Winds light but
OL,21,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
